{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Recipe",
  "name": "Kaki Fry",
  "text": "Kaki Fry\n\nPreparation time:\n\nCooking time:\n\nYield: 1\n\nIngredients\n\n5 Large Oysters\n\nBatter\n\n½ Egg\n\n2 tbsp Flour\n\nA sprinkle of Water (approx. 1 tbsp)\n\nSoft Bread Crumbs (approx. 300ml or 1¼ cups)\n\nVegetable Oil: 180 °C, 2 cm deep\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Heat the oil to 180 °C.\n\n2. Rinse the oysters in a bowl of salty water, removing any sand. Put on a paper towle to dry.\n\n3. Season with salt and pepper.\n\n4. Put the flour in a bowl and add the beaten egg. Mix until smooth. Add water until the batter has the consistency of light cream.\n\n5. Put the flour on a shallow dish or plate.\n\n6. Put the breadcrumbs on a tray.\n\n7. Flour the oysters, dip them in the batter, then coat with breadcrumbs.\n\n8. Deep fry for 3 minutes, turning once.",
  "recipeYield": "1",
